  const sonoSteps=[st('Set tension and fixed wire','Check the wire and pulley; include hanger mass in the suspended load.','Set hanging load','The same wire keeps linear density fixed throughout a series.',88,76),st('Set the vibrating length','Move the second bridge to the chosen separation and put a light rider near the middle.','Place bridge and rider','Only the segment between the two bridges is the measured vibrating length.',59,48),st('Sound the tuning fork','Strike the fork on an approved soft pad and couple it to the sounding box; watch the rider.','Excite the wire','A strong response occurs when the fundamental matches the fork.',27,30),st('Tune from both directions','Vary bridge separation on either side of the strongest response, then measure and repeat.','Find resonant length','Save resonant observations; arbitrary off-resonance lengths do not test the required relation.',58,75)];
